<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Math Workbook Page 72</title>
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .page {
            background-color: white;
            width: 850px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: relative;
        }
        .header-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            color: #0056b3;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0056b3;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .header-top .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .header-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .content-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }
        .column-left {
            flex: 1;
            padding-right: 30px;
            border-right: 1px solid #a3c2e0;
        }
        .column-right {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .q-title {
            color: #0056b3;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .sub-q {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding-left: 10px;
        }
        .handwriting {
            color: #d32f2f;
            font-family: 'Kaiti SC', '楷体', 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .circle-op {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border: 1px solid #0056b3;
            border-radius: 50%;
            vertical-align: middle;
            margin: 0 4px;
        }
        .q3-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .q3-col {
            width: 48%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .calc-block {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .calc-block .handwriting {
            margin-left: -5px;
        }
        .placeholder {
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .q4-diagrams {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .q4-answers {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .q4-ans-col {
            width: 48%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }
        .page-num {
            background-color: #e0f0ff;
            color: #0056b3;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header-top">
            <div class="logo-area">
                <span style="font-size: 20px;">📘</span>
                <span>同步解析与测评</span>
            </div>
            <div>数学 五年级 下册</div>
        </div>

        <div class="header-title">第 2 课时&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第 1 课时练习课</div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content-container">
            <!-- Left Column -->
            <div class="column-left">
                <!-- Question 1 -->
                <div class="q-title">1. 填一填。</div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (1) \( \frac{3}{4} + \frac{2}{5} = ( \) <span class="handwriting">\( \frac{2}{5} \)</span> \( ) + \frac{3}{4} \)，应用了（<span class="handwriting">加法交换</span>）律。
                </div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (2) \( \frac{1}{5} + \frac{3}{8} + \frac{5}{8} = \frac{1}{5} + ( \frac{3}{8} + \frac{5}{8} ) \)，应用了（<span class="handwriting">加法结合</span>）律。
                </div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (3) \( 1 - \frac{4}{15} - \frac{7}{15} = 1 - ( \frac{4}{15} + \frac{7}{15} ) \)，应用了（<span class="handwriting">减法的性质</span>）。
                </div>

                <!-- Question 2 -->
                <div class="q-title">2. 在 \( \bigcirc \) 里填上适当的运算符号。</div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (1) \( \frac{3}{8} + \frac{4}{9} + \frac{5}{9} = \frac{3}{8} + ( \frac{4}{9} \)
                    <span class="circle-op handwriting">+</span>
                    \( \frac{5}{9} ) \)
                </div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (2) \( \frac{3}{8} + \frac{4}{9} - \frac{4}{9} = \frac{3}{8} + ( \frac{4}{9} \)
                    <span class="circle-op handwriting">-</span>
                    \( \frac{4}{9} ) \)
                </div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (3) \( \frac{8}{7} - \frac{5}{9} - \frac{4}{9} = \frac{8}{7} - ( \frac{5}{9} \)
                    <span class="circle-op handwriting">+</span>
                    \( \frac{4}{9} ) \)
                </div>
                <div class="sub-q">
                    (4) \( \frac{8}{7} - \frac{4}{9} + \frac{4}{9} = \frac{8}{7} - ( \frac{4}{9} \)
                    <span class="circle-op handwriting">-</span>
                    \( \frac{4}{9} ) \)
                </div>

                <!-- Question 3 -->
                <div class="q-title">3. 选择合适的方法进行计算。</div>
                <div class="q3-container">
                    <div class="q3-col">
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( \frac{3}{4} + \frac{1}{3} - \frac{5}{6} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{9}{12} + \frac{4}{12} - \frac{10}{12} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{3}{12} = \frac{1}{4} \)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( \frac{2}{3} - ( \frac{5}{6} - \frac{5}{8} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{16}{24} - ( \frac{20}{24} - \frac{15}{24} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{16}{24} - \frac{5}{24} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{11}{24} \)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( 1 - \frac{3}{4} - \frac{1}{20} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 - ( \frac{15}{20} + \frac{1}{20} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 - \frac{16}{20} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{4}{20} = \frac{1}{5} \)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="q3-col">
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( \frac{5}{8} + ( \frac{3}{4} - \frac{1}{6} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{15}{24} + \frac{18}{24} - \frac{4}{24} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{29}{24} \)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( \frac{7}{9} + \frac{5}{7} + \frac{5}{9} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{12}{9} + \frac{5}{7} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{4}{3} + \frac{5}{7} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = \frac{28}{21} + \frac{15}{21} = \frac{43}{21} \)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="calc-block">
                            <div>\( \frac{5}{8} + \frac{5}{7} + \frac{3}{8} - \frac{3}{14} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = ( \frac{5}{8} + \frac{3}{8} ) + ( \frac{5}{7} - \frac{3}{14} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 + ( \frac{10}{14} - \frac{3}{14} ) \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 + \frac{7}{14} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 + \frac{1}{2} \)</div>
                            <div class="handwriting">\( = 1 \frac{1}{2} \)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column -->
            <div class="column-right">
                <!-- Question 4 -->
                <div class="q-title">4. 计算下面图形的周长。</div>
                <div class="q4-diagrams">
                    <div class="placeholder" style="width: 140px; height: 90px;">
                        [Diagram: Triangle with sides \( \frac{1}{2} \) dm, \( \frac{7}{10} \) dm and base \( \frac{4}{5} \) dm]
                    </div>
                    <div class="placeholder" style="width: 150px; height: 90px;">
                        [Diagram: Rectangle with width \( \frac{7}{12} \) m and height \( \frac{1}{3} \) m]
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="q4-answers">
                    <div class="q4-ans-col handwriting">
                        <div>① \( \frac{1}{2} + \frac{4}{5} + \frac{7}{10} \)</div>
                        <div>\( = \frac{5}{10} + \frac{8}{10} + \frac{7}{10} \)</div>
                        <div>\( = \frac{20}{10} = 2 (\text{dm}) \)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="q4-ans-col handwriting">
                        <div>② \( \frac{7}{12} + \frac{7}{12} + \frac{1}{3} + \frac{1}{3} \)</div>
                        <div>\( = \frac{14}{12} + \frac{2}{3} \)</div>
                        <div>\( = \frac{7}{6} + \frac{4}{6} = \frac{11}{6} (\text{m}) \)</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Question 5 -->
                <div class="q-title">5. 周末，五(1)班有 \( \frac{2}{7} \) 的同学到郊外劳动，有</div>
                <div class="sub-q" style="margin-left: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    \( \frac{2}{5} \) 的同学到图书馆读书，还有 \( \frac{11}{35} \) 的同学留<br>
                    在家中。留在家中的同学比出门的同学<br>
                    多还是少？多或少几分之几？
                </div>
                <div class="handwriting" style="padding-left: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                        <span>\( \frac{2}{7} + \frac{2}{5} = \frac{24}{35} \)</span>
                        <span>\( \frac{11}{35} < \frac{24}{35} \)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>\( \frac{24}{35} - \frac{11}{35} = \frac{13}{35} \)</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Question 6 -->
                <div class="q-title">6. 有一个装满水的水池，若第一次放出一池</div>
                <div class="sub-q" style="margin-left: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    水的 \( \frac{3}{8} \)，第二次放出一池水的 \( \frac{1}{4} \)，第三次又<br>
                    注人一池水的 \( \frac{4}{7} \)。现在池子里的水占池子<br>
                    的几分之几？
                </div>
                <div class="handwriting" style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                    \( 1 - \frac{3}{8} - \frac{1}{4} + \frac{4}{7} = \frac{53}{56} \)
                </div>

                <!-- Empty Table Placeholder -->
                <div class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100px; margin-top: 20px;">
                    [Table: Empty grading grid]
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="page-num">72</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
